# S8-5 (QUALIFICATION): lifecycle churn at EIGHT seats, on c2-packed-tp4-8-gate: 16 sessions over 8 seats (eight replacements: the first eight fill
# the seats and each of the next eight is admitted into the seat a departure freed, so BOTH blocks churn), 1,024 tokens out each, the last user
# short (1,536 tokens: the one-bucket ladder under churn).
# READ: 16 sessions completed, no engine death, no hold while a seat is free, no refusal, no abort; every release logged; the kernel cache +0 programs
# after the warm (a program compiled after a capture is the hang's sequence); the DRAM hold's lines (a hold with every seat busy is the ninth user
# waiting, not a failure).
# Duration (estimate): 90-150 min. Stop rule: any engine death, abort, refusal or hold with a seat free stops the window.
# SHIP WINDOW: bar: 0 aborts, 0 refusals, 0 engine deaths over the 16 sessions, and no hold while a seat is free.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8 SHIP window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's stop rule, its minutes and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8 is the SHIPPING image: the base SB8 builds
# from this branch with the eight-seat profile baked in as its serving default (ENV QWEN_C2_PROFILE) and the platform session cap baked as its
# seat count (ENV THATCH_SERVING_SESSION_CAP). Every job serves that one image, so the bytes that pass are the bytes that ship. Each job still
# names its profile explicitly, so none relies on the baked default. A commit that changes a file the image carries needs a new SB8 build and a
# new tag in every template.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=churn
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,8192,16384,32768,60000,90000,120000,123136,4096,8192,16384,32768,60000,90000,120000,1536
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=1024
C2_GATE_JIT=record
